<title>THAILAND: Shinawatra Computer Q1 net falls.</title>
<headline>Shinawatra Computer Q1 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>		    (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				  1997			  1996</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		3.62	vs		5.66</p>
<p>    Net		     501.58	vs	    784.57</p>
<p>NOTE: Results are audited . Shinawatra Computer and Communication Plc is a major telecommunicationS company.</p>
<p>Shinawatra said its first quarter profit declined because the earning contribution from its subsidaries fell to 300 million baht ($11.5 million) from 480 million baht in the same quarter last year.</p>
<p>($1 = 26 baht)</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
